<title>FRANCE: M6 interim profit rises 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>M6 interim profit rises 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net consolidated			     215	 up 2.3 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - M6, controlled by Lyonnaise des Eaux, said first-half consolidated profit rose 2.3 percent on a 12.1 percent rise in sales.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
